evied. Valid 2025-06-20 even 2025-08-14."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trängselskatt och tider då skatt tas ut från 2025-06-20 till och med 2025-08-14"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/355"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Congestion taxes Stockholm - valid 2025-06-20 even 2025-08-14"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trängselskatt Stockholm - Giltig 2025-06-20 till och med 2025-08-14"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://swagger.entryscape.com/?url=https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/rowstore/dataset/a702a82a-918f-4f08-84fa-ae2dcfda49b5/swagger"}},{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/384","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"text/csv","dct:title":"Congestion taxes Stockholm 2025-08-15.csv"},{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/385","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/384"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/384"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Congestion taxes and times when tax is levied. Valid 2025-08-15 even 2025-11-30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trängselskatt och tider då skatt tas ut från 2025-08-15 till och med 2025-11-30"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Congestion taxes Stockholm - valid 2025-08-15 even 2025-11-30"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trängselskatt Stockholm - Giltig 2025-08-15 till och med 2025-11-30"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"}},{"@id":"https://transportstyrelsen.entryscape.net/store/7/resource/387","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://transportst